      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi @bd_, thanks for the feedback!\n\nWe did not add explicit support for dynamically changing the collider area. If the values are animated, it is unexpected behaviour.\n\nVRC_VoiceRegionOverride is based on Trigger (Collider) callbacks. If you make changes to it while a player is inside the trigger, the changes won't apply until the player leaves and re-enters. There's currently a fade between enabled and disabled falloff, so the transition is smoother but we aren't sure what the expected sound behaviour would be for a changing collider.\n\nWhat is the use case for animating VRC_VoiceOverrideRegions trigger colliders?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
