      "value": "@{5c1475afb7ce126e9e0e3a39|full_name}: Moving the collision region should be supported, as should enabling/disabling the region itself. (update Jul 25: This is not correct, and enabling/disabling the region is NOT supported. See comments below, and our docs.)\n\nI have added notes regarding the non-support of changes to the SpatialAudioSource and VoiceOverrideRegion properties at run-time.",
