      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: Nope, that's changed. Per our docs, enabling/disabling the region (gameObject or component) isn't supported and is discouraged. This is due to the behavior of the Unity onExitTrigger event.\n\nWe encourage users to move regions that need to be toggled on/off into the floor or otherwise out of the way via an animation.",
      "viewerReactions": null
