      "statusChangeID": "5d3a06e0f01a0b5796122532",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Due to the way PlayerAudioOverride is applied, animating the properties isn't supported and will not work. Instead, we recommend setting up multiple regions with the varying settings you wish to have available. When you want to swap these regions, move the trigger collider into position using an animation.\n\nWe explicitly do not support enabling/disabling the region (gameObject or component). This is due to the behavior of the Unity onTriggerExit event.",
      "viewerReactions": null
